cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite both the article and this artifact."
title: "FinEdu-CodeGen: A Preregistered Reliability Benchmark for Live LLM-Generated Computational Finance Code"
abstract: >-
  A preregistered 2x2 reliability benchmark (convention information x structural
  scaffolding) for live LLM-generated computational finance code in a
  securities-investment classroom: 6 knowledge points x 3 task types x 4 prompt
  conditions x 3 models = 2,160 generations, scored format-neutrally against
  analytic/solver oracles, with a deterministic + blinded error-coding pipeline.
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-17
license: MIT
